{"id":"bessern","lemma":"bessern","pos":"verb","rank":1140,"glosses":["to improve, to better"],"ipa":"/ˈbɛsɐn/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/46/De-bessern.ogg/De-bessern.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"present":{"1s":"bessre","1p":"bessern","2s":"besserst","2p":"bessert","3s":"bessert","3p":"bessern"},"preterite":{"1s":"besserte","1p":"besserten","2s":"bessertest","2p":"bessertet","3s":"besserte","3p":"besserten"},"perfect":{"1s":"habe gebessert","1p":"haben gebessert","2s":"hast gebessert","2p":"habt gebessert","3s":"hat gebessert","3p":"haben gebessert"},"future":{"1s":"werde bessern","1p":"werden bessern","2s":"wirst bessern","2p":"werdet bessern","3s":"wird bessern","3p":"werden bessern"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"bessre","2p":"bessert"}},"subjunctive":{"conditional":{"1s":"würde bessern","1p":"würden bessern","2s":"würdest bessern","2p":"würdet bessern","3s":"würde bessern","3p":"würden bessern"}}},"nonFinite":{"participle":"gebessert"},"examples":[{"text":"Ihr habt euch gebessert.","en":"You've gotten better.","words":[{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you (pl.)","l":"ihr"},null]},{"text":"Seine Gesundheit bessert sich.","en":"His health is improving.","words":[{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},{"g":"health"},null,{"g":"oneself"}]},{"text":"Sie wollen ihre Arbeitsbedingungen bessern.","en":"They want to better their working conditions.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to want"},{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},{"g":"working conditions"},null]},{"text":"Das wird sich in zwei, drei Tagen bessern.","en":"It'll be better in two or three days.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"two (numerical value…"},{"g":"three (numerical value…"},{"g":"to meet"},null]},{"text":"Allmählich besserte sich alles.","en":"Things slowly got better.","words":[{"g":"gradually"},null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"everything"}]}]}